{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object found, grab it, move to destination, check properties. If not, scan area.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Sequence>     <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    />     <Action ID = GrabObject    />     <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> </Sequence> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    />",
